0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"24","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"修满24学分,且满足该学程修读要求。要求修读1个创新创业学院开设的创新创业微专业（学程），以及1个非本专业独立开设的微专业（学程）；或者2个创新创业学院开设的创新创业微专业（学程）。修读学分不足部分可在全校所有本科生课程中任意选修。完成创新创业路径的学生，毕业时将获得市场营销专业毕业证书及学士学位证书。创新创业微专业（学程）详见https://ehall.fudan.edu.cn搜索“ 微专业(学程)/辅修学士学位项目方案”查询“创新创业学院”。完成学程修读要求的学生可获得相应的微专业（学程）证书。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"21","rawId":"21","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"辅修学士学位路径","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"55","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"修满55学分。要求至少修读1个本专业进阶课程，即专业进阶I组课程（15学分）和1个外院开设的辅修学士学位项目。辅修学士学位应与主修学士学位归属不同的本科专业大类。\n完成辅修学士学位路径的学生，毕业时将获得市场营销专业毕业证书、学士学位证书及辅修学士学位。辅修学士学位项目课程设置详见https://ehall.fudan.edu.cn  搜索“ 微专业(学程)/辅修学士学位项目方案”查询。完成辅修学士学位项目修读要求，且达到学校毕业和学位授予要求的学生可获得相应的辅修学士学位证书。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"-100","rawId":"-100","parent":null,"level":"1.1.1","title":"其他","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":0.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"0","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[]},{"id":"2~27","rawId":"2","parent":null,"level":"1.1","title":"融合创新能力","type":null,"rule":{"requiredSubModuleNum":0,"requiredCredits":7.0,"postCreditsRequired":0.0,"postRequiredCourseNum":0,"integrationCreditsRequired":0.0,"integrationRequiredCourseNum":0,"requiredCourseNum":0,"autoSubModuleNum":false,"showRequiredCredits":"7","requireAll":false,"requireAny":true},"limit":{"creditsUpperLimit":null,"courseNumUpperLimit":null},"note":"1.多渠道支持并资助学生参加国外世界一流水平高校进行一学期的学习与交换。\n2.全员参加“朝阳行动”，教授带队，学以致用，培养高度的社会责任感。\n3.体验科研训练，在解决复杂问题的过程中，激发批判性思维和科研潜力。鼓励完成1项复芏计划（FDUROP）项目，激发创新志趣。","reference":false,"referenceId":null,"courses":[{"code":"102","name":"复芏计划(FDUROP)","credits":0.0,"required":false,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"7","name":"国际交流","credits":0.0,"required":false,"term":null,"rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"BA40002","name":"毕业实习","credits":1.0,"required":true,"term":"8","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"BA40001","name":"毕业论文","credits":4.0,"required":true,"term":"8","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}},{"code":"BA30055","name":"社会调查","credits":2.0,"required":true,"term":"5","rule":{"requiredCourse":null,"integrationCompulsory":null,"postGraduateDegreeType":null}}]}],"rowCount":114,"completeModules":true,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-31T16:44:01Z","programNotes":[{"title":"学科专业简介","text":"&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 复旦大学市场营销学系成立于1999年，其前身可追溯至20世纪80年代恢复的市场营销教学与研究。作为国内首批对标国际商学院模式设立的市场营销专业，该系致力于培养兼具全球视野与中国市场实践能力的复合型人才。本专业以“宽口径、厚基础、重能力、求创新”为原则，培养掌握管理学、经济学与市场营销理论，具备市场调研、营销策划、数字营销等实践能力的专业人才。根据2024年专业排名，复旦大学市场营销专业稳居全国前三，毕业生就业竞争力连续多年位列国内高校前列。"},{"title":"培养目标","text":"&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 按照“宽口径、厚基础、重能力、求创新”的人才培养要求，以“2+X+Y”（2是通识和专业教育，X是多元发展路径，Y为融合创新能力）为途径培养德智体美劳全面发展，具备管理、经济、法律和市场营销等方面的知识和能力，能在工商企业、金融机构、事业单位及政府部门从事市场分析、营销策划、品牌管理工作的市场营销学科高级专门人才。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 本专业要求学生掌握管理学、经济学和市场营销学的基本理论和基础知识；掌握市场调研、消费者行为分析的定性定量方法；具备敏锐的市场洞察力、创新的营销策划能力和高效的营销执行能力；熟悉国内外市场营销的法规政策与行业规范；熟练掌握一门外语及现代信息技术工具，具有独立解决实际营销问题的综合素质。"},{"title":"基本要求","text":""},{"title":"学分要求","text":"&nbsp;\n\n1、 专业进阶路径：108学分&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;\n本路径学生需要完成108学分（含实践学分不低于17学分；含美育学分不少于2学分，其中至少在“美学和艺术史论类”或“艺术鉴赏和评论类”课程中修读1学分，并至少参与一项艺术实践活动；劳动教育不少于32学时，并满足劳动周教育要求），包括通识教育课程15学分、专业培养课程62学分、专业进阶模块I修读24学分、融合创新能力模块7学分。\n2、 本科荣誉项目：110学分&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n在专业进阶路径基础上，修读荣誉课程不少于5门课。荣誉项目课程设置和修读要求请见管理学院“本科荣誉项目”实施方案。下载地址：https://jwc.fudan.edu.cn/（复旦大学教务处）专业培养-常用文档。鼓励学生选择荣誉项目。 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n3、 跨学科学发展路径：108学分&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n微专业（学程）详见https://ehall.fudan.edu.cn/ &nbsp; 搜索“ 微专业(学程)/辅修学士学位项目方案”查询。完成学程修读要求的学生可获得相应的学程证书。 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\n4、市场营销+AI双学士学位项目：137学分&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n详见https://ehall.fudan.edu.cn/ &nbsp; 搜索“ 专业方案查询”&nbsp; 。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;"},{"title":"学位要求","text":"\n\n（一）本科学位&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n4年级结束时，如达到学士学位要求者理授予管理学学士学位。\n\n（1）修满规定的学分，达到本科教学培养方案规定的各项要求。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n（2）以符合学生毕业时所在专业教学培养方案规定的所有课程的有效成绩为准计算平均绩点，且此平均绩点大于或等于2.0。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n（3）在此基础上，达到管理学院“本科荣誉证书”获得条件的授予“本科荣誉证书”，具体要求请见管理学院“本科荣誉项目”实施方案。&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\n市场营销+AI学士双学位项目，如达到此双学士学位要求者授予管理学-工学双学士学位。\n\n\n"},{"title":"课程体系与科研训练体系","text":"\n注：上图供参考，以课程列表为准。"},{"title":"课程设置与修读要求","text":"备注：每学期选修学分不得超过32学分。"}]}